   "title": "What's this in English?",
   "title_uz": "Bu inglizchada nima?",
   "coursebook": {
    "page": 16,
    "use": "this/that/these/those, verb be (it/they), ko'plik, raqamlar 11-100"
   },
   "goals_uz": [
    "Narsalarni this/that/these/those bilan ko'rsatish",
    "Ko'plik shakli",
    "11–100 raqamlari"
   ],
   "explanation_uz": "<b>this / that / these / those</b>\n\n👉 <b>Yaqindagi:</b> this (bitta) — <i>This is a phone.</i> · these (ko'p) — <i>These are keys.</i>\n👉 <b>Uzoqdagi:</b> that (bitta) — <i>That is a bag.</i> · those (ko'p) — <i>Those are books.</i>\n\n❓ What's this in English? → <i>It's a pen.</i>\n❓ What are these? → <i>They're pens.</i>\n\n<b>Ko'plik (plural):</b>\n• odatda +s: pen → pens\n• s, x, ch, sh dan keyin +es: box → boxes, watch → watches\n\n🔢 <b>11–100:</b> 11 eleven · 12 twelve · 13 thirteen · 14 fourteen · 15 fifteen · 20 twenty · 30 thirty · 40 forty · 50 fifty · 100 a hundred\n💡 Urg'u: thirTEEN (13) ≠ THIRty (30).",
